Rule 3 (tuple axis elements must be within valid dimension range of input tensor)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tuple(int)} |= ∀i ∈ [0, v_2.len - 1] : v_2[i] ≥ 0 - ndim(v_1) ∧ v_2[i] ≤ ndim(v_1) - 1
