Rule 8 (The absolute value of a negative integer axis must not exceed the input tensor dimensions, and a positive integer axis must be strictly less than the dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= if v_2 < 0 then 0 - v_2 ≤ ndim(v_1) else v_2 < ndim(v_1)
